<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000219> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000219> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000031> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000219> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "generically depends on at all times"@en .
