<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000224> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000224> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000008> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000224> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has last instant"@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000224> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000203> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000224> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "t has last instant t' =Def t' last instant of t"@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000224> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "The last hour of a year has last instant midnight December 31."@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000224> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "has last instant"@en .
