<http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/usageNote> "Used to document the primary agent (organization or person) responsible for the resource. This will be \"Industrial Ontology Foundry\" for IOF artifacts." .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "references"@en-us .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "related resource that is referenced, cited, or otherwise pointed to by the described resource"@en-us .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/rights> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
