<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/supplychain/SupplyChain/> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "The https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/202603/supplychain/SupplyChain/ version of this \nontology was modified to deprecate four constructs, namely, Gain of Role, Loss of Role, Group of Persons, and Artifact Function. These constructs are moved to the IOF Core ontology (https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/202401/core/Core/). The deprecated constructs are linked to the IOF Core equivalent constructs using owl:equivalentClass." .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/supplychain/SupplyChain/> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/acronym> "SCO" .
